27:["$","p","Read the university-specific profiles for current merit-funding requirements, application dependencies and costs that remain payable. Historical award descriptions should not be used as a new intake's confirmed amount or eligibility rule.",{"children":"Read the university-specific profiles for current merit-funding requirements, application dependencies and costs that remain payable. Historical award descriptions should not be used as a new intake's confirmed amount or eligibility rule."}]
